    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a feeling, kael. it's everything. i look at the streets and the people and it's all just... loops. we work, we eat, we sleep, we wait for the lights to flicker. there's no way out of this cycle. nothing ever changes. it's like we're already dead, just moving through the smog.",
